vellum (0.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * JSON theme engine: --theme flag, built-in dark/dracula/solarized themes
  * User themes at $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/vellum/themes/<name>.json
  * Per-language syntect theme override via code.by_language in theme JSON
  * Theme preview: vellum --theme <name> without a file shows built-in demo
  * In-app About page accessible via the 'a' key

